            // an instance like any other.  With a `ref_obj` Lhs and an
            // `operation` Rhs it clones the assign and runs
            // `CompileHelper::reduceExpr` over the WHOLE Rhs; the
            // `vpiMultiConcatOp` arm of `UHDM/templates/ExprEval.cpp:3797`
