            //   * `n`     = reduceExpr(operands[0]) run through `get_value`
            //               (clamped to [0,1000]);
            //   * `width` = the ELEMENT's `VpiSize`;
            //   * a `vpiBinaryConst` element is ZERO-PADDED to `width` and the
